Description: the Couchbox dashboard, its guide, its wrappers and its applications
 The dashboard is the shell of a Couchbox OS machine: the session starts it, it
 lists what the machine can play, and it starts applications through stable
 wrappers. This package carries the dashboard, the guide that listens for the
 guide key, the launcher wrappers, the store and the settings, and the catalogue
 of optional applications they read.

